  COMPILE FAILURE (fixed): first latexmk run died with
    "pdfTeX error: Font ecti1095 at 600 not found ... no output PDF produced".
  Cause: \usepackage[T1]{fontenc} with default Computer Modern needs the EC
  bitmap fonts generated on demand, and ~/.TinyTeX is read-only in this sandbox
  so mktextfm cannot write them. Fix: load lmodern (Latin Modern, Type 1, real
  T1 coverage) before fontenc. This is exactly the env.md "cannot install into
  TinyTeX, rewrite to use what is available" case. Recorded here because any
  future run using T1 fontenc will hit it.

